GuardedCallsCapability
├── authorization
│   ├── only Merkle-authorized self-calls execute
│   ├── no storage, setter or limit mapping exists
│   ├── literals, queries and bound sources are pinned in each leaf
│   └── threshold changes require a new accepted root and leaf role
├── calls and queries
│   ├── execute ordered normal calls from adapter and return unmodified data
│   ├── snapshot delta baselines before writes
│   ├── evaluate Before before any calls and other observations after all calls
│   ├── use STATICCALL and selected complete uint256 return words
│   ├── compare literals and immutable approved calldata words
│   ├── enforce Equal, GreaterOrEqual and LessOrEqual
│   ├── reject unsigned deltas in the opposite direction
│   └── rollback every write on call, query or condition failure
└── lending integration
    ├── pin every byte except intended nested lending amounts
    ├── preserve health checks on Aave, Morpho and Euler lending
    ├── borrowing and collateral withdrawal use leaf-pinned minimums
    └── preserve recipe and liquidity execution health boundaries
